<title>POLAND: DROSED 96 GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>DROSED 96 GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drosed group results for the</p>
<p>year ending December  31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							    1996	1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit			8,09  vs    11,21</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			  6,77  vs    11,25</p>
<p>    Group net profit				2,98  vs     6,98</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Drosed Siedleckie Zaklady</p>
<p>Drobiarskie SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     194,61  vs   131,35</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			164,10  vs   105,51</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit		  0,00  vs     0,03</p>
<p>    Group income tax				2,14  vs     3,52</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			     1,20  vs     0,07</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		    0,88  vs     4,70</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			 2,45  vs     4,94</p>
<p>    Group investment			     28,26  vs    13,06</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
